["<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">伊</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>意大利；彼（指代男性）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">イ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かれ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">江</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>江；入江；海湾</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">え</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">僚</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>同僚；伙伴；官员</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">リョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">同僚</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">どうりょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">同事；同僚；合作者</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">官僚</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんりょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">官僚；政府官员；官僚制度</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">吉</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>吉利；喜悦；祝贺</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キチ・キツ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">よし</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">不吉</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふきつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">不吉利；不祥；凶兆</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">盛</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>繁荣；旺盛；兴盛；装满；交配</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">セイ・ジョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">も.る・さか.る・さか.ん</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">盛ん</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さかん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">繁荣；兴盛；昌盛；成功；流行；广泛；普遍；活跃；生动；有活力；旺盛；热烈；强劲；热情；热心；殷切；频繁；反复</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">盛り</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さかり</span><span class=\"k-wz\">盛季；高峰；旺季；盛开；正酣；盛年；黄金时期；年华正茂；发情；求偶期</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">盛る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さかる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">变得旺盛；增强力度；变得更加活跃；繁荣；兴盛；蓬勃发展；发情；处于发情期；交配</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">皇</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>皇帝；天皇</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コウ・オウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">天皇</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">すめらぎ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">日本皇帝；日本天皇</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">皇居</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうきょ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">皇居；天皇居所</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">臨</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>面对；面临；会见；出席；看</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">リン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">のぞ.む</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">臨時</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">りんじ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">临时；暂时；临时性；特别；非常；额外</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">臨む</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">のぞむ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">俯临；眺望；面向；面对；面临；遭遇；处理；应对；出席；参加；到场；莅临</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">壊</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>破坏；毁坏；打破；拆毁；崩溃</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カイ・エ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">こわ.す・こわ.れる・やぶ.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">壊す</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こわす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">破坏；摧毁；拆毁；毁坏；破坏；损坏；毁损；破开（纸币等）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">壊れる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こわれる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">破损；破裂；崩塌；毁坏；受损；发生故障；停止运转；落空；破裂；失败；中止；破坏（气氛、形象等）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">破壊</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はかい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">破坏；摧毁；扰乱；（应用程序）崩溃；闪退</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">債</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>债务；债券；贷款</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">サイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">負債</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふさい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">债务；负债</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">興</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>兴趣；乐趣；振兴；复兴；唤起</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コウ・キョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">おこ.る・おこ.す</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">興味</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きょうみ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">兴趣；好奇心；热情</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">興業</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうぎょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">兴办产业；创办新的工业企业</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">興奮</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうふん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">兴奋；刺激；激动；唤起</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">儀</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>仪式；规则；事务；事件；情况</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ギ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">行儀</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぎょうぎ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">礼仪；举止；行为</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">礼儀</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">れいぎ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">礼仪；礼节；礼貌</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">儀式</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぎしき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">仪式；典礼；仪礼；仪轨</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">創</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>创伤；开始；创造；伤害；起源</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ソウ・ショウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">つく.る・はじ.める・きず・けず.しける</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">創作</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">そうさく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">创作；制作；创意作品（小说、电影等）；原创作品；（创意）写作；虚构；编造；捏造</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">創刊</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">そうかん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">创刊；创办（报纸、杂志等）；创刊号发行</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">創造</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">そうぞう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">创造；创作；（上帝的）创造</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">障</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>妨碍；伤害；损害</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ショウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">さわ.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">故障</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こしょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">故障；失灵；损坏；失效；出故障；伤害；损伤；受伤；问题；困难；障碍；阻碍；反对；抗议</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">障害</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しょうがい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">障碍；阻碍；妨碍；困难；障碍；缺陷；残疾；功能障碍；障碍赛马；障碍赛跑；障碍赛（田径）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">障子</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しょうじ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">障子；纸质推拉门</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">継</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>继承；继续；修补；嫁接；继母（继亲关系）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ケイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">つ.ぐ・まま-</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">継続</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けいぞく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">继续；延续；维持；持续</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">中継</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちゅうけい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">中继；连接；传递；中继广播；转播</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">継ぐ</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">つぐ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">继承；接任；接替；打补丁；缝补；修补；添加（炭等）；补充；续添；接着说；鼓（气）；连接（棋子）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">筋</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>肌肉；肌腱；情节；大纲；条理</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">すじ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">筋</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">すじ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">肌肉；筋；肌腱；血管；静脉；动脉；纤维；纤维状物；丝；线；条纹；斑纹；道理；逻辑；理由；情节；故事线；血统；世系；家系；流派；学派；派系；才能；天赋；资质；来源；渠道；信息源；知情人；内线人士；（围棋、将棋）正着；合理的着法；（将棋）第九纵线；头盔的接缝；（略）筋鱼糕（用鱼筋、鱼皮等制成的有嚼劲的鱼糜制品）；社会地位；身份；沿着；在……上；条；根；道（计数词）；街；条街（大阪地名后缀）；百文（江户时期货币计数词）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">筋肉</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きんにく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">肌肉</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">大筋</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おおすじ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">大纲；摘要；要点；基本要领</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">闘</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>战斗；斗争；竞争</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">トウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">たたか.う・あらそ.う</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">戦闘</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せんとう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">战斗；作战</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">奮闘</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふんとう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">奋力；苦战；顽强拼搏；激战；激烈战斗</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">葬</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>埋葬；搁置</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ソウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ほうむ.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">葬式</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">そうしき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">葬式；葬礼；葬仪</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">葬る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ほうむる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">埋葬；安葬；入土；隐瞒；压下；搁置</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">避</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>回避；躲避；避开；躲开；逃避</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヒ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">さ.ける・よ.ける</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">避ける</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さける</span><span class=\"k-wz\">避开；避免</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">避難</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ひなん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">躲避；避难；撤离；逃生；寻求庇护</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">司</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>掌管；管理；官员；政府机构；主任</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span 